{"id":6,"titleZh":"音乐中的幽默","titleEn":"Humor in Music","date":"1959-02-28","dateZh":"1959 年 2 月 28 日","concepts":"不协调感、机智与讽刺、戏仿与滑稽","thesis":"音符讲不了笑话，音乐之所以能逗人发笑，全靠打破预期——把正经的规则故意扭偏或让两种不搭的元素撞在一起。","plain":"喜剧的共同点是“反常”与“落空”。音乐搞笑分层次：低阶的只是模拟拍死蚊子或喇叭响；高阶的则在不毁掉美感的前提下做反讽，比如在规整古典小品里突然跳调收尾，或用严肃配器演奏荒唐情节。","scenes":["奏完皮斯顿严肃乐团突然乱入铜管进行曲的段落与《蚊子舞》（末尾真拍死蚊子）后，伯恩斯坦在钢琴拆解普罗科菲耶夫《古典交响曲》加沃特舞曲如何连跳三个调制造机智反转。","先把《两只老虎》唱成小调并指挥全场观众“越唱越伤心哭泣”，随即接入马勒《第一交响曲》里低音提琴领奏的荒诞葬礼进行曲。"],"category":"基础乐理","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV17J411Q7wP","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV17J411Q7wP","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 音乐中的幽默","duration":"59:27","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/humor-in-music","repertoire":[{"composer":"Walter Piston","piece":"The Incredible Flutist (Ballet Suite)","titleZh":"神奇的长笛手组曲","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/d6/30/e5/d630e5d7-cb14-8652-c540-d5c1e8ae5479/mzaf_4823754233503602137.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/ballet-suite-from-the-incredible-flutist-i/1440606153?i=1440606157&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Leonard Bernstein & New York Philharmonic","recordingTrack":"Ballet Suite from The Incredible Flutist: I. Introduction - Siesta in the Market Place","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Walter%20Piston%20The%20Incredible%20Flutist+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Walter%20Piston%20The%20Incredible%20Flutist"},{"composer":"Paul White","piece":"Mosquito Dance","titleZh":"蚊子舞","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Music/c3/1c/21/mzm.rpybaitf.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/mosquito-dance-op-62-no-5-arr-f-buchtel/477836786?i=477837323&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Vic Chiodo & Paul Hartley","recordingTrack":"Mosquito Dance, Op. 62, No. 5 (Arr. F. Buchtel)","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_quer